        "design:deities-are-mythologizations-not-agents — Hornvale's religion domain derives every deity from a salient phenomenon and commits the provenance (predicate:derived-from-phenomenon); a god is a community's account of the sky or the weather, and the causal chain terminates in astronomy and climate. A mortal contending with an immortal antagonist presupposes a supernatural agent with will, which the world deliberately does not contain (Constitution §1, sim first). Different, not deficient."
